msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:47
#: 0100a37e8b454cb482a7aee70f62ac77 1d78d865759b4ee4b511e148d1d4c589
#: 57fab1b3083d441096eda42161406927 b2479fce0e204ac9ae5b3566ea4593d6
#: f86df199489d4065a326bd8a8d54b009
