msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:48
#: 056b4c3b14c04e508141b69bbe797613 4d58bfb92d314d56add5661091eff050
#: 9587c441288340d289af752ddddabb32 d3a14d24d47a4c89a216ae67ac6635a6
#: fa68a74044c94c529b5e03256625a5ad
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` provides several options for MPPT enable "
"and disable depending on autopilot events."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_OPTIONS<BATT_OPTIONS>` 提供了多个选项，用于根据飞控事件启用或禁用 MPPT。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:50
#: 107cf53f935c40dab99cbd5a37321e01 4baefbb4f9694b89ada7fe186c317b27
#: 5521c21bb3914860a25c4db1bd7befc8 5b97bde3cea34b8e9d22e662f9c99536
#: dbb4361c41e1485582950f086f7ded6f
msgid ""
"the MPPT can be manually turned on or off using an RC channel switch setup "
"with its ``RCx_OPTION`` = 172."
msgstr "MPPT 可通过 RC 通道开关手动开启或关闭，将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为 172。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:52
#: 0ffe39e4e4f84ee89d82ee2c3d516945 9cfec7a34b1c4455b374bd6eddd6ab7b
#: b6bb9e8a779f4c77913458f31e835427 d3eebb86f75f41e09be4f6177e302b93
#: d7fdeb5082de4fa4b5cf66c110dd0719
msgid "Check the MPPT board's parameters by connecting through \"SLCAN\""
msgstr "通过「SLCAN」连接检查 MPPT 板的参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:54
#: 1f1f269009e4475c898bd8560effa53d 574c863d81b84bb99d9d042b31c09d32
#: 89b2d8a43e9a4d579581ac0667868e5c 9de8c58d97f34ddea6d685b4b8b3341e
#: cd8da9141092482bb1f320480e42aa94
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner's SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) page"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的 SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:55
#: 017804e7e1b14f1a96f083b9f42756fc 0dadd935252b4888875ec76922c46c85
#: 3b432cc60844497b9821583a10a1b3ea 9f6a92f12ae44c8e96dda882e97a9acc
#: d8936f2badca4451bde9639dbfae6be9
msgid ""
"From the top right, select the COM port for the autopilot's SLCAN connection"
" (normally one higher than the MAVLink COM port)"
msgstr "在右上角选择飞控 SLCAN 连接的 COM 端口（通常比 MAVLink COM 端口高一个编号）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:56
#: 30a06ddaf5124f53b9c6601039c3f04d 513cd1fc2bed47f9a9a9d123ca17ce2b
#: a310c641c250471d828afd63c3ce5e36 a781123b90e249478db07e7549ec921e
#: cfdfdfaf8e2645679f03e9ddd51713fc
msgid ""
"Press the \"SLCan Mode CAN1\" button. The table should be filled in as shown"
" below.  If this does not work try changing to the Config screen, connect "
"over MAVLink and set :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT <CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` = 1.  Return "
"to SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) page and press the \"SLCan"
" Mode CAN1\" button again"
msgstr ""
"按「SLCan Mode CAN1」按钮。表格应如下图所示填充完成。如果无效，请尝试切换到 Config 界面，通过 MAVLink 连接并将 "
":ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT <CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` 设置为 1。然后返回 SETUP >> Optional "
"Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) 页面，再次按「SLCan Mode CAN1」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:62
#: 28bb6288c18c49b5b72522a3106fd5de 66a77cff72d044f993c30e47edd98348
#: c16570684c2a451b82e481434cc63ede cac0faf737a642c4b6627b561812d603
#: caff914c88d44ebe93b112d897370d7f
msgid "Press the \"Menu\" button to view or change some of the MPPT's settings"
msgstr "按「Menu」按钮查看或更改部分 MPPT 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:64
#: 17fef7e954a141dfb9f8f8fa5d424875 6d23254f72ca4383bac137f43439d444
#: 7be1f07e5bc346fb9935e2568d1c2818 9c9fdb072a3a44a5974983af6f4871d8
#: b7a42ca8ce8549e49727ef2b1d8292e0
msgid ""
"mppt.vout_set configures the maximum voltage from the VOUT pin.  This should"
" be equal to the battery's voltage when fully charged."
msgstr "mppt.vout_set 配置 VOUT 引脚的最大输出电压。该值应等于电池充满时的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:65
#: 1e810ddde1864116a3176bed92a45445 33227d66892046a085e5f3d2edeeb8dc
#: 454e92f6f51a4974a0f54bf65e83abd3 4930fd810f8949cb916f5916176b2089
#: 5b3d7febfade48f2bf5fcda212a2d5c7
msgid ""
"mppt.dcdc_en configures the board's startup behaviour.  If \"0\" the MPPT "
"will not charge the battery until the autopilot is armed.  If \"1\" the MPPT"
" will always attempt to charge the battery"
msgstr "mppt.dcdc_en 配置板卡的启动行为。若为「0」，MPPT 在飞控解锁前不会为电池充电。若为「1」，MPPT 将始终尝试为电池充电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:66
#: 2966ec0982c749238b7e87d30db4d680 6b34f4217fb54524a7dd7683818e1661
#: 8b10d3a9437d459a8d7f39a6f8cc460b 937ee4f3015a4dacaa3cb841cf94a765
#: c66aef7fbb2c4acb9ee4eec2f876c0ae
msgid ""
"uavcan.node_id should normally be left at \"0\" to allow the autopilot to "
"dynamically allocate the MPPT's DroneCAN node id but if multiple DroneCAN "
"battery monitors or MPPTs are used you can manually set this to some value "
"between 0 and 127 (e.g. \"50\") and then set :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM "
"<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to the same number"
msgstr ""
"uavcan.node_id 通常应保持「0」以允许飞控动态分配 MPPT 的 DroneCAN 节点 ID，但如果使用多个 DroneCAN "
"电池监控器或 MPPT，您可以手动将其设置为 0 到 127 之间的某个值（如「50」），然后将 :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM "
"<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为相同数字"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:69
#: 28298f236eaa4e1589e2e7ad0d33b258 285afd6c46594b46b2fede533e47f917
#: 2a1e23e176b346139e9eb494bf44ec5e 3e24cb434b4c4bd58315d593e355ea81
#: c6434505ac5b4e5e82c0c833007ccb67
msgid "Connecting more than one MPPT"
msgstr "连接多个 MPPT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:71
#: 0d794e5c9eb14d43b1fb8b3446cdf92d 43e597d47e6f4e6085bf8bf5c281f5b4
#: a2e2d9cc26554a8abac9173b6f24f948 c2c56a221ef04daebe2c95ce13fc3e24
#: cebb90acbd00446097975ec39bf2c7ec
msgid ""
"More than one Packet Digital MPPT board can be connected in parallel to the "
"same battery (but different solar panels) to increase the total current "
"provided."
msgstr "可以将多个 Packet Digital MPPT 板并联到同一电池（但连接不同的太阳能电池板），以增加总输出电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:73
#: 2a395a42688148098c77f27cdc640547 4fc875bac73a452791e7babe4caef304
#: 62fb0ba7eb1c4968abc871814f91c9e5 7e8de00280b14c1aaff4bec8d470dc3f
#: f90f22d2ee534aaba66def9968021a23
msgid "To allow the autopilot to connect to all the MPPTs:"
msgstr "要让飞控连接到所有 MPPT："

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:75
#: 0cb96fefd5514047bcbc6fcf08663a97 a2b8930f693f4df3a1607cf12bff0457
#: c1b377d965924e229a811e49276ffee0 d0f4fdd77b9545e7bc86eb66320fb24c
#: d63bf7fc2f104b1fa9f466e5ddc79cc0
msgid ""
"Enable one battery monitor per MPPT by setting :ref:`BATTx_MONITOR "
"<BATT_MONITOR>` = 8"
msgstr "为每个 MPPT 启用一个电池监控器，将 :ref:`BATTx_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为 8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:76
#: 3249a94fa7c54a9a9ddbcb9715565db7 963229f09d1149f48c63ae2adf44ffeb
#: b7890d619caf4b38b8e87276fedb925d d884793bf1cd4e1bba8c877433dc3bf4
#: e934b6ddb8764eb2955e7eb5939872b4
msgid ""
"Use Mission Planner's SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) page's "
"\"Menu\" button to manually configure the uavcan.node_id of each MPPT"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的 SETUP >> Optional Hardware >> UAVCAN(DroneCAN) "
"页面的「Menu」按钮手动配置每个 MPPT 的 uavcan.node_id"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:77
#: 7b9b01bb54a54f36ab13aceb81d942cf 9706a7c4b3d648cbb3079d397be44e9d
#: a532f2daefd446e5ac548575e342bebb c420a5c400c14a22ae242d20aaf6edfe
#: e5f6a9773a3a4e389cbc2ad5306eb38b
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BATTx_SERIAL_NUM <BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to match the uavcan.node_ids "
"set above."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BATTx_SERIAL_NUM <BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为与上面设置的 uavcan.node_id 匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:78
#: 253d6eb138c5429d842b11ce78a5cd2a 26f34fbcf3c14e33b0349b150263e6f1
#: 6a3c46c7be18417a9c72e6fd47888f36 6a762e1b841f4d71857f7886598dd317
#: 96f0ba0029ec431da861426266137e64
msgid ""
"You can sum all the MPPT currents using a \"SUM (10)\" power monitor type. "
"See :ref:`common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner`."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用「SUM (10)」类型的电源监控器对所有 MPPT 电流求和。请参阅 :ref:`common-power-module-"
"configuration-in-mission-planner`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-packetdigital-mppt.rst:81
#: 14bdb8f964754a0d919b3bc9e2c61898 28aef24cf8a94e2cbc1f4612b877b52e
#: 5b1ce2db051049fc86c9b99c7c845214 902f1f9616a644f78471e019746d01d5
#: bff576766cdc4879a8498475c32ec5eb
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"
